1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,230
Someone saw the smoke.

2
00:00:01,260 --> 00:00:01,960
But who?

3
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:02,960
A fishing boat,

4
00:00:02,990 --> 00:00:04,340
drifting toward the rocks.

5
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:05,430
One figure on deck,

6
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:06,420
waving a white shirt.

7
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:07,150
Alive?

8
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:08,010
Or infected?

9
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:09,010
He has one rule

10
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:09,910
for strangers:

11
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:11,760
nobody lands without a check.

12
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:13,000
Twenty-four hours

13
00:00:13,030 --> 00:00:14,740
on the dock. No contact.

14
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:15,380
He rows out

15
00:00:15,410 --> 00:00:16,080
and tows her in.

16
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:18,550
She's alone. Thirsty.

17
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:20,320
Her engine is dead.

18
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:21,620
He shares a gallon of water.

19
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:22,980
Then she coughs.

20
00:00:23,010 --> 00:00:25,050
A deep, wet cough.

21
00:00:25,090 --> 00:00:25,870
A fever.

22
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:27,100
On the first night.

23
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:29,510
No bites. No scratches.

24
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:31,450
Except one cut on her palm.

25
00:00:31,490 --> 00:00:33,320
Swollen, black at the edges.

26
00:00:33,350 --> 00:00:34,520
An infection.

27
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:36,450
He has twelve doses of antibiotics.

28
00:00:36,490 --> 00:00:37,480
She needs six.

29
00:00:37,510 --> 00:00:39,280
Half of everything he has.

30
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:39,890
He decides

31
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:40,790
in ten seconds.

32
00:00:40,830 --> 00:00:41,640
Morning.

33
00:00:41,670 --> 00:00:42,620
The fever breaks.

34
00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:43,140
She tells him

35
00:00:43,170 --> 00:00:44,400
why she came.

36
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:46,480
A radio. A safe zone.

37
00:00:46,510 --> 00:00:48,220
Forty miles north.

38
00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:50,150
Six boats followed that voice.

39
00:00:50,180 --> 00:00:51,670
None came back.

40
00:00:51,710 --> 00:00:52,970
The voice never breathes.

41
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:54,140
It's a recording.

42
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:55,650
Then the sky turns green.

43
00:00:55,690 --> 00:00:59,740
Part five. A storm is coming. Follow for part five.
